      "body": "Can't reproduce this anymore. With the layout from the description (`parent/sub1..3`, one test each), `pytest --collect-only -q parent parent/sub1`:\n\n- 8.4.0: 1 test collected (only sub1)\n- 9.0.0, 9.1.1, main (c9c19f8): 3 tests collected\n\nLooks like the #12083 fix in 9.0.0 (\"`pytest a/ a/b` would cause only tests from `a/b` to run\") covered it.\n",
